<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">SUPPORT AND APPEALS</view
  ><view class="heading">遇到问题，说清楚就好。</view
  ><view class="muted">账户受限也可申诉，请勿填写密码或支付密钥。</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load"
    >{{error}} · 点击重试</view
  ><view class="card"
    ><view class="title">客服与申诉</view
    ><view class="notice">当前反馈进入内部运营后台，正式企业客服尚待配置。</view
    ><textarea
      class="feedback-input"
      value="{{message}}"
      bindinput="input"
      maxlength="1000"
      placeholder="描述任务时间、类型、订单编号和问题"
    /><button
      class="button"
      disabled="{{busy || message.length < 2}}"
      bindtap="submit"
    >
      提交反馈
    </button></view
  ><view class="card"
    ><view class="title">我的反馈记录</view
    ><view wx:if="{{!tickets.length}}" class="empty">还没有反馈记录。</view
    ><view wx:for="{{tickets}}" wx:key="id" class="list-item"
      ><view class="row"
        ><text class="caption">{{item.time}}</text
        ><text class="pill"
          >{{item.state === 'resolved' ? '已回复' : '待处理'}}</text
        ></view
      ><view class="muted space">{{item.message}}</view
      ><view wx:if="{{item.reply}}" class="notice"
        >回复：{{item.reply}}</view
      ></view
    ></view
  ></view
>
